00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.840
Ukraine drone missions lost satellite links above 100 miles per hour after SpaceX added an overnight star-shield speed limit. This is SpaceX Daily, episode 130.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:21.540
Sergei Besskresnov, a presidential advisor on defense technologies, told Hermod's gay the cap applies to the military grade service and took effect between the 13th and 14th of October.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:25.480
