00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.500
and the same failed sorties.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:36.600
Civilian Starlink units still run inside the limits they already had.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:41.300
The change landed as tensions rose over Ukrainian strikes on Russian oil sites.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:46.940
Starshield had been what let Ukraine fly some unmanned aircraft much faster, including

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:50.360
