00:04:06.787 --> 00:04:10.607
runs, so a silent ceiling is a reasonable operational complaint.

00:04:11.087 --> 00:04:15.547
A statement of why the cap exists and whether it reverses is what would close the gap.

00:04:16.307 --> 00:04:20.247
